WEBVTT

00:10.410 --> 00:12.360
Maya-nee...

00:14.070 --> 00:16.200
Kuon? Why are you here?!

00:16.520 --> 00:20.790
Since you were likely to wake up soon, 
your older sister said I could come inside.

00:20.790 --> 00:23.370
Maya-nee, why would you 
decide that on your own?

00:24.150 --> 00:27.130
The truth is, Mister Asahi, 
I have a favor to ask you.

00:45.230 --> 00:50.110
