00:45.230 --> 00:50.110
<b>Starting Life
 in Another 
World With 
My Big Sister</b>

01:58.010 --> 02:00.900
<b>Episode 10</b>

01:58.010 --> 02:00.900
My Amazing
Little Brother

02:04.820 --> 02:07.770
I wondered what kind of favor you needed.

02:10.080 --> 02:12.560
I never imagined it'd be helping you move.

02:12.560 --> 02:15.300
That is everything from inside.

02:16.170 --> 02:18.190
All that is left is for my lady to arrive.

02:18.190 --> 02:20.720
Gotta admit, that was exhausting.

02:20.720 --> 02:23.490
I am sorry I disturbed your rest for this.

02:23.490 --> 02:25.290
Oh, no need to apologize.

02:25.290 --> 02:28.470
Getting 5,000 mani for a day's work 
makes it a great temp job.

02:28.810 --> 02:32.350
Let's get this packing finished 
before Gloria gets here.

02:32.350 --> 02:33.130
Oh, that vase...

02:33.880 --> 02:37.210
It is an antique worth one million mani,
 so please be careful with it.

02:40.730 --> 02:42.050
That was a joke.

02:42.050 --> 02:43.310
Hey!

02:43.310 --> 02:45.760
Unhand me!

02:44.850 --> 02:45.760
Here she comes.

02:46.020 --> 02:49.130
I <i>am</i> leaving this house!

02:49.130 --> 02:50.390
Please reconsider!

02:50.060 --> 02:51.940
Mistress, please!

02:50.390 --> 02:51.940
Sh-She's so strong!

02:53.420 --> 02:54.320
Running away?

02:54.320 --> 02:54.900
Yes.

02:54.900 --> 02:57.650
You're all too clingy!

02:58.730 --> 03:03.330
Oh, yeah. You did mention Gloria 
was going to start living on her own.

03:03.330 --> 03:05.970
Please do not trouble 
yourself with the details.

03:06.630 --> 03:08.780
Okay! Let us depart, you two.

03:08.780 --> 03:11.360
Is this okay? Skipping out like this, I mean.

03:11.360 --> 03:12.540
This will not do.

03:13.640 --> 03:16.880
Mistress, this unreasonable 
behavior stops now.

03:17.300 --> 03:19.380
<i>This butler strikes me as a "Sebastian."</i>

03:19.380 --> 03:20.200
Sebastian!

03:20.200 --> 03:21.830
He really <i>is</i> called that?!

03:22.830 --> 03:25.760
Even if it's you, Sebastian, if you 
try to stop me, I won't hold back!

03:27.680 --> 03:28.390
These are...

03:28.890 --> 03:31.800
In my youth, I was an adventurer.

03:31.800 --> 03:34.690
Forfeiting the first strike by 
letting chatter distract you...

03:34.690 --> 03:37.580
You make your title of Golem Class weep.

03:37.580 --> 03:39.150
He uses steel threads!

03:39.150 --> 03:41.990
He's like a tough boss who shows up
 in the latter half of a story!

03:41.990 --> 03:44.790
Only strong characters like that 
use such a specialized weapon!

03:44.790 --> 03:45.570
You seem thrilled.

03:46.120 --> 03:48.290
Now, what will you do?

03:50.900 --> 03:52.710
Wh-What?

03:52.970 --> 03:56.940
To that, I say, "Graaahhh!"

04:01.130 --> 04:04.510
She brute-forced her way through. 
That's Miss Musclebrain for you.

04:04.510 --> 04:06.670
Okay, we're going now.

04:07.000 --> 04:11.910
Mistress, your father is
 very worried about you.

04:12.430 --> 04:15.310
He hopes you will curb your 
adventurer work and behave more like

04:15.310 --> 04:17.520
the daughter of a respectable family.

04:18.150 --> 04:22.750
I am sick of sycophants
and balls and tea parties!

04:22.750 --> 04:24.330
Now, if you will excuse me.

04:24.330 --> 04:25.860
Come on, Asahi, Kuon.

04:25.860 --> 04:27.000
R-Right.

04:27.000 --> 04:29.540
Kuon, you could stop her, could you not?

04:30.590 --> 04:34.280
My only desire is for 
my lady to do as she pleases.

04:41.710 --> 04:43.100
What's wrong?

04:43.100 --> 04:47.370
Knowing you've witnessed my family
troubles makes me all embarrassed!

04:48.250 --> 04:49.260
Don't be.

04:49.520 --> 04:52.640
<i>After all, you could say 
my family has its problems, too.</i>

04:53.000 --> 04:55.730
It's my father's fault for 
being so overprotective.

04:55.730 --> 04:59.310
Even without relying on him or our name,
 I can live perfectly well on my own.

04:59.990 --> 05:03.840
<i>When I was tossed into this 
world alone, I was anxious, too.</i>

05:04.660 --> 05:06.660
<i>I guess I'll help her out as much as I can.</i>

05:07.370 --> 05:09.030
We have arrived, mistress.

05:09.920 --> 05:12.880
Starting today, this shall be my new base!

05:12.880 --> 05:14.750
That's a super-nice house.

05:14.750 --> 05:16.790
It's the Brigandine family villa.

05:17.120 --> 05:18.840
Villa?

05:20.540 --> 05:22.470
Then you don't need help!

05:22.810 --> 05:25.550
When the daughter of a noble 
runs away for show, it looks like this.

05:26.880 --> 05:30.050
Well, guess I'll make a start 
carrying everything in.

05:36.340 --> 05:38.840
Next up is this table.

05:40.070 --> 05:42.940
This is really heavy.

05:42.940 --> 05:46.410
Having a man around makes all 
the heavy lifting so much easier.

05:46.410 --> 05:48.070
Um, thanks.

05:49.350 --> 05:50.820
<i>Wait, is this...</i>

05:51.960 --> 05:54.730
<i>...what it looks like when 
newlyweds move into a new house?!</i>

05:54.730 --> 05:56.980
Oh, I suddenly feel all bashful!

05:55.850 --> 05:57.210
Don't just let go!

05:56.980 --> 05:58.120
I'm so sorry!

05:57.790 --> 05:58.930
Ow.

05:59.560 --> 06:01.610
May I use this handkerchief?

06:03.340 --> 06:06.840
No, those are mine!

06:06.840 --> 06:12.810
Ikusaba Asahi, was it? He is deceiving
 our young lady, no doubt about it.

06:13.210 --> 06:15.270
Adventurer rank: Dragon Class.

06:15.650 --> 06:19.440
The Fierce Tiger, Tigga Hildebrandt, age 42.

06:19.440 --> 06:23.600
You are someone I am certain 
can bring back our young lady.

06:23.600 --> 06:25.690
Being 42 has nothing to do with anything.

06:25.970 --> 06:30.250
A tiger will use all of his strength
 even when hunting a rabbit.

06:30.250 --> 06:32.340
Is that not said about a lioness?

06:32.340 --> 06:34.250
Does it really matter which it is?

06:35.620 --> 06:39.420
We shall have Ikusaba Asahi
 experience a little pain.

06:51.720 --> 06:55.420
A tiger should not push himself 
when he gets sudden stomach pains.

06:55.420 --> 06:57.850
Dear, oh dear. It seems 
no one can fight old age.

06:57.850 --> 06:59.890
As for the mistress, 
we will monitor the situation.

06:59.890 --> 07:01.270
H-Hey, wait up!

07:06.330 --> 07:09.830
"Being overprotective isn't good"?

07:10.610 --> 07:11.780
Is she making a joke?

07:12.200 --> 07:15.610
Mister Asahi's older sister. 
As I suspected, she is no ordinary person.

07:17.080 --> 07:19.330
Now, have another cup of tea.

07:19.950 --> 07:22.990
Y-You've already shown me 
more than enough kindness.

07:22.990 --> 07:25.060
Oh, come now! Don't say that!

07:25.060 --> 07:27.800
B-But this is already my twelfth cup.

07:27.800 --> 07:30.380
Mister Asahi's stomach 
seems to be filled to the brim.

07:30.380 --> 07:32.680
Kuon! Where have <i>you</i> been?

07:32.680 --> 07:34.340
I patrolled the area a little.

07:34.340 --> 07:38.450
With just the two of us here, I didn't know
 what to do, so I kept pouring him tea.

07:38.450 --> 07:40.730
Could you not have had a conversation?

07:40.730 --> 07:45.030
But I don't know what to say to a boy.

07:45.460 --> 07:50.260
Kuon, you're the only one I can rely on. 
Any ideas how to keep Asahi here at my house?

07:50.260 --> 07:52.760
What if you ask him to live with you?

07:52.760 --> 07:54.110
L-L-L-Live together?!

07:55.130 --> 07:56.740
Good morning, honey.

07:57.120 --> 08:00.910
I-I-I couldn't! There are 
so many steps before that!

08:00.910 --> 08:03.580
I meant as a live-in worker.

08:03.580 --> 08:04.500
A live-in worker?

08:05.330 --> 08:07.750
Welcome home, my lady.

08:08.530 --> 08:10.460
That works. That <i>totally</i> works.

08:10.460 --> 08:14.090
Or you could create a reason for Mister 
Asahi to need to frequent this house.

08:14.090 --> 08:14.890
What reason?

08:15.200 --> 08:18.130
Form a clan and use this mansion as your base.

08:18.130 --> 08:20.570
I see! Brilliant as usual, Kuon!

08:20.570 --> 08:21.630
What do you think?

08:21.630 --> 08:23.140
Huh? A-About what?

08:29.560 --> 08:31.600
Sorry. I know you're on your lunch break.

08:31.600 --> 08:35.050
It's no problem! And if it's about clans, 
you can ask me anything!

08:35.460 --> 08:38.410
You can swallow first, y'know. 
But yeah, you're a big help.

08:40.410 --> 08:44.470
If you're going to form a clan, 
the Guild would be happy to have you.

08:44.470 --> 08:46.040
Huh? Why?

08:46.040 --> 08:48.760
It was the same with Siegfried's Balmung.

08:48.760 --> 08:51.800
If there's a famous clan around, 
they become the face of the Guild.

08:51.800 --> 08:53.330
I see.

08:53.330 --> 08:57.050
And we get an influx of new adventurers
 who say they want to form clans, too.

08:57.050 --> 08:59.010
Hm? Asahi, is that you?

08:59.010 --> 09:00.330
Sieg-san!

09:00.330 --> 09:01.900
Oh! The real deal!

09:01.900 --> 09:02.770
Is this a date?

09:03.040 --> 09:04.570
No, not at all!

09:04.570 --> 09:06.440
You doing some shopping, Sieg-san?

09:06.880 --> 09:09.400
Less "shopping" and more like "getting handouts."

09:09.970 --> 09:13.650
If you fry 'em and sprinkle 'em with sugar,
 they're yummier than you'd think.

09:14.330 --> 09:15.160
Bye now.

09:17.300 --> 09:21.510
I-I understand how you feel. 
He's a star you really looked up to, right?

09:21.960 --> 09:24.960
Life's full of ups and downs, isn't it?

09:27.170 --> 09:30.670
Well, setting that aside... 
What are you going to name your clan?

09:30.910 --> 09:34.630
A name, huh? I haven't thought about it.

09:34.630 --> 09:38.010
It's necessary for the application, 
so take your time to think of one.

09:38.010 --> 09:39.240
Will do.

09:39.240 --> 09:44.850
I don't think you'll regret forming a clan. 
Some quests are clan-only, after all.

09:45.490 --> 09:47.810
I just heard something wonderful.

09:47.810 --> 09:49.410
Uh, Sophie?

09:49.410 --> 09:53.080
If you're forming a clan, please include me.

09:53.080 --> 09:56.420
But I mean, I haven't even 
decided on a name yet.

09:56.420 --> 09:57.820
Hiya, Sophie!

09:57.820 --> 09:58.820
Hiya!

09:58.820 --> 10:01.780
When'd you become friends with Sophie?
You're such a good communicator!

10:02.160 --> 10:05.850
Exalted Hero! Exalted Hero! 
I promise I'll prove useful! Please?

10:05.850 --> 10:07.210
R-Really?

10:07.210 --> 10:09.170
I'm better at things than you might expect!

10:09.510 --> 10:13.440
I've trained my skills just for you,
 Exalted Hero! Behold!

10:11.530 --> 10:13.440
Why's she so close to him?

10:13.440 --> 10:14.620
Status!

10:15.050 --> 10:16.760
Level 27?!

10:16.760 --> 10:18.300
<i>Th-That's higher than I expected.</i>

10:18.650 --> 10:22.800
When I went around all over the place, 
casting Heal on people, my level shot up.

10:22.800 --> 10:25.310
That's a pretty common way 
to level up for healers.

10:25.640 --> 10:29.300
<i>S-Still, Sophie's a novice, 
but she's more capable than I thought.</i>

10:29.300 --> 10:31.800
<i>And her graph's a lot bigger than mine.</i>

10:31.800 --> 10:34.320
Asahi-kun, what does your 
status screen look like?

10:35.160 --> 10:36.760
Oh, I'd love to see it!

10:39.530 --> 10:43.780
That's not something you show off 
to people, right? Your own strength, I mean.

10:45.140 --> 10:47.700
That's something only the 
strongest say, Exalted Hero!

10:47.700 --> 10:51.380
That was so cool! You're really 
amazing, Asahi-kun! AmazAsa!

10:51.380 --> 10:53.790
<i>I-I somehow managed to get out of that.</i>

10:54.450 --> 10:55.750
Asahi!

10:55.980 --> 10:57.840
Gloria? Kuon?

10:57.840 --> 10:59.470
What a coincidence, running into—

11:04.350 --> 11:05.780
What's wrong?

11:06.110 --> 11:07.430
You angry about something?

11:12.170 --> 11:13.360
She left.

11:13.700 --> 11:15.320
Do you understand now?

11:15.320 --> 11:16.760
U-Understand what?

11:16.760 --> 11:21.170
My lady's personality is as you see it. She has 
no common sense or ability to live on her own.

11:21.170 --> 11:23.370
If I did not look after her, she would die.

11:23.370 --> 11:26.620
That's not something I thought 
I'd hear her personal maid say.

11:26.620 --> 11:30.870
My lady does not have a single friend or
 ally she can depend on. Which is why...

11:31.900 --> 11:34.070
Mister Asahi, if you would 
become that for her...

11:34.580 --> 11:37.120
Yes, it would make me happy as well.

11:37.120 --> 11:41.890
So would it be possible for you to seriously 
consider the matter regarding the clan?

11:43.700 --> 11:46.100
But she does have a friend
 and ally she can depend on.

11:46.830 --> 11:47.310
What?

11:47.720 --> 11:49.310
She's standing in front of me.

11:53.680 --> 11:56.900
Then, it would make me happy 
if you became the second.

11:57.840 --> 12:01.580
We have to cheer Gloria up a bit first, though.

