12:04.030 --> 12:07.030
<b>Starting Life
 in Another 
World With 
My Big Sister</b>

12:16.330 --> 12:19.210
<i>Right now, the candidates for this clan are...</i>

12:19.660 --> 12:22.260
<i>Maya-nee, me, Sophie...</i>

12:22.260 --> 12:24.720
<i>Gloria, and Kuon, right?</i>

12:25.120 --> 12:27.220
<i>Kilmaria </i>is<i> a demon, after all.</i>

12:28.320 --> 12:31.980
<i>Hm, it kinda seems like 
it'll be a super strong clan.</i>

12:31.980 --> 12:33.230
<i>Aside from me.</i>

12:33.620 --> 12:37.820
<i>And it'll increase the chances of 
people finding out how weak I am.</i>

12:37.820 --> 12:40.820
<i>This might end up being 
me digging my own grave.</i>

12:40.820 --> 12:41.860
Asahi.

12:43.100 --> 12:45.350
Are you worried about something?

12:45.350 --> 12:46.700
Y-You can tell?

12:47.570 --> 12:50.080
Well, I <i>am</i> your big sister. 
I can tell by your aura.

12:50.440 --> 12:51.960
M-My aura?

12:55.370 --> 12:58.080
I see. So being a clan 
means becoming allies.

12:58.370 --> 13:00.620
Yes, I think it's a good idea.

13:01.230 --> 13:04.240
But it feels like it'll give us 
more annoying stuff to deal with.

13:04.240 --> 13:07.480
Even so, having more allies is a good thing.

13:07.480 --> 13:12.330
Back in our old world, your communication 
issues meant you never made any real friends.

13:12.330 --> 13:15.070
Can you not dig into my trauma 
from when I was a gloomy introvert?!

13:15.990 --> 13:18.180
You're the main character 
of our story, Maya-nee,

13:18.180 --> 13:20.320
so I think you should be the one to decide.

13:22.010 --> 13:23.820
You're the main character, Asahi.

13:24.700 --> 13:25.320
Huh?

13:26.420 --> 13:28.710
Who was it that protected Kilmaria?

13:29.670 --> 13:33.630
Who worked harder than 
anyone to rescue Sophie?

13:34.100 --> 13:36.960
Who crossed swords and came 
to an understanding with Gloria,

13:36.960 --> 13:40.790
and won both Gloria's favor and Kuon's trust?

13:41.900 --> 13:43.700
That was all you, right?

13:44.510 --> 13:47.550
I only helped you out a little.

13:48.410 --> 13:51.770
But my stats are low and my skills are...

13:51.770 --> 13:53.560
Those things aren't strength.

13:54.740 --> 13:56.420
You should be more confident.

13:56.420 --> 13:58.330
You aren't weak now, Asahi.

13:58.720 --> 14:00.400
You're my amazing little brother.

14:15.530 --> 14:20.170
And so, we moved forward with 
the plans for forming a clan, but...

14:20.520 --> 14:22.920
It's just too heartbreaking, Exalted Hero.

14:23.360 --> 14:25.880
This is a grave situation.

14:26.520 --> 14:28.590
Who could have foreseen that Mister Asahi...

14:29.530 --> 14:32.930
would be turned to stone by a basilisk.

14:32.930 --> 14:34.430
m 0 0 l 0 0 l 23 0 b 24 0 24 1 24 1 l 24 14 b 24 15 23 15 23 15 l -21 15 b -21 15 -22 15 -22 14 l -22 1 b -22 1 -22 1 -22 1 b -22 1 -22 0 -21 0 l -21 0 b -21 0 -21 0 -21 0 b -21 0 -21 0 -21 0

14:32.930 --> 14:34.430
Basilisk

14:32.930 --> 14:34.430
A giant lizard-type monster who can turn those who meet its gaze to stone

14:35.120 --> 14:39.820
I thought it'd be an easy treasure-hunting 
quest and let my guard down. It's my fault.

14:39.820 --> 14:40.900
Asahi...

14:40.900 --> 14:44.700
I'm sorry. If only I knew the
Cure Stone spell...

14:44.700 --> 14:46.230
There is only one option.

14:46.230 --> 14:50.030
I shall go ask Huan at the pawnshop if 
she has any items that cure petrification.

14:50.030 --> 14:53.820
I'll go defeat every monster that 
looks like it might drop an item!

14:53.820 --> 14:57.260
I'll go ask at the temple 
if there's anything we can do!

14:59.610 --> 15:02.500
Asahi, sit tight for a little bit.

15:03.620 --> 15:05.850
<i>How could... this happen...</i>

15:06.250 --> 15:08.030
<i>How could this have happened?!</i>

15:08.030 --> 15:10.220
<i>And I'm petrified but still conscious?!</i>

15:10.450 --> 15:12.880
<i>So nothing's gonna rock 
this rock's free will?</i>

15:12.880 --> 15:14.220
<i>No one wants to hear that!</i>

15:14.850 --> 15:18.730
Still, even as a rock, you're cute, Asahi.

15:18.730 --> 15:21.670
<i>Too close! Too close! Too close! Too close!</i>

15:24.440 --> 15:26.570
<i>Wait!</i>

15:26.990 --> 15:28.880
Just kidding.

15:31.470 --> 15:33.450
Maybe sleeping next to me will cure you?

15:33.450 --> 15:35.100
<i>Why would it?</i>

15:35.430 --> 15:38.210
You're cold, hard, and very 
uncomfortable to sleep with.

15:38.210 --> 15:39.960
<i>Well, that's because I'm a rock.</i>

15:40.380 --> 15:45.340
What if I stroke you gently all over?

15:45.340 --> 15:47.420
<i>Stop that! I'm serious! Don't do that!</i>

15:47.420 --> 15:50.590
<i>For a male in puberty, 
that's torture in all kinds of ways!</i>

15:51.380 --> 15:54.310
Nothing I tried ended up working in the end.

15:55.350 --> 15:59.020
Huan said she was out of stock of 
all items that can cure petrification.

15:59.020 --> 16:03.370
The temple didn't have any space 
to enshrine the Exalted Hero.

16:03.370 --> 16:06.610
All the drops were mani, 
so it was no use at all!

16:07.020 --> 16:09.500
I see. Not much we can do about that.

16:09.500 --> 16:11.710
We'll have to come up 
with some other method.

16:14.000 --> 16:14.610
I know!

16:14.610 --> 16:16.890
Maybe putting him in
 hot water will cure him!

16:16.890 --> 16:18.620
<i>What am I, some kind of frozen food?!</i>

16:18.620 --> 16:22.150
All right! Shall we all take a bath together?

16:22.150 --> 16:23.860
That's a wonderful idea!

16:23.860 --> 16:26.130
Let's get the Exalted Hero nice and clean!

16:26.440 --> 16:29.380
<i>What? A bath? What?</i>

16:29.380 --> 16:31.300
<i>W-Wait.</i>

16:31.300 --> 16:35.030
<i>Wait. Hang on a minute!</i>

16:40.580 --> 16:43.020
Your fatigue just melts away, doesn't it?

16:43.600 --> 16:45.860
This bath is a little small, but...

16:45.860 --> 16:48.130
This is how the commoners live.

16:48.130 --> 16:49.650
It's good in its own way.

16:50.090 --> 16:52.650
<i>This isn't good! 
What's with this situation?!</i>

16:55.620 --> 16:58.990
We put him in the bath, but he's not 
showing any signs of getting better.

16:58.990 --> 17:01.450
<i>Please don't stand in front of me!</i>

17:01.450 --> 17:04.960
<i>I can't close my eyes! 
I-I-I don't know where to look!</i>

17:05.250 --> 17:08.530
Asahi! I will return you to normal!

17:09.760 --> 17:11.170
As an ally in your clan...

17:11.170 --> 17:13.800
Oh, the poor Exalted Hero.

17:15.500 --> 17:16.490
Asahi!

17:16.490 --> 17:17.580
Mister Asahi.

17:17.580 --> 17:18.930
Exalted Hero!

17:23.290 --> 17:26.030
You have some good friends, Asahi.

17:35.900 --> 17:38.160
I'll go ahead and get out 
before the rest of you.

17:40.910 --> 17:42.880
I'll wipe down Asahi's body, too.

17:42.880 --> 17:44.790
<i>Watch how you're holding me! Watch it!</i>

17:51.210 --> 17:53.280
<i>That was like practicing asceticism...</i>

17:53.280 --> 17:56.570
How many years has it been since 
we last took a bath together, Asahi?

17:56.570 --> 17:58.430
<i>Am I a hanger rack now?</i>

18:01.050 --> 18:02.930
So that trump card really is our only option.

18:03.750 --> 18:04.930
<i>Come again?</i>

18:05.610 --> 18:07.190
A maiden's kiss!

18:07.190 --> 18:09.190
<i>What did you say?!</i>

18:09.520 --> 18:14.430
A prince's kiss has been the standard method
 of breaking a curse since long, long ago!

18:14.430 --> 18:17.740
<i>How "long ago" exactly? 
And you aren't a prince, Maya-nee!</i>

18:17.740 --> 18:19.640
And Asahi is a princess, after all.

18:19.640 --> 18:21.060
<i>No, I'm not! Hold up.</i>

18:21.060 --> 18:22.300
<i>Wait, wait, wait!</i>

18:22.300 --> 18:25.160
<i>Wait, wait, wait, wait!</i>

18:25.160 --> 18:27.160
<i>Wait!</i>

18:27.160 --> 18:31.380
What are you... doing?!

18:35.050 --> 18:36.760
What's the big idea, Kilmaria?

18:36.760 --> 18:40.010
That's what I'm asking <i>you</i>! 
What do you think you're doing?

18:40.580 --> 18:43.790
I was trying to undo Asahi's 
petrification with a little smooch.

18:43.790 --> 18:45.100
Petrification?

18:45.100 --> 18:47.980
Did he get hit by a 
basilisk's gaze or something?

18:48.280 --> 18:50.910
I will not allow you to 
have Asahi's first kiss!

18:50.910 --> 18:54.210
That isn't going to cure his petrification.

18:54.210 --> 18:56.300
Then, what do I do?

18:56.300 --> 18:57.990
Leave it to me.

18:58.820 --> 19:00.520
Total Healing.

19:05.020 --> 19:05.870
Asahi!

19:06.570 --> 19:08.120
Are you all right, Asahi?

19:08.690 --> 19:12.470
Huh? Oh, um, yeah. More or less.

19:12.470 --> 19:13.710
That aside...

19:13.710 --> 19:16.710
Kilmaria, I didn't know you 
could use recovery magic.

19:17.080 --> 19:20.710
Well, there's no harm in 
learning it just in case, is there?

19:22.570 --> 19:24.470
You really saved me, Kilmaria.

19:25.210 --> 19:28.430
That was quite the misfortune, Asahi.

19:28.430 --> 19:29.880
Hey, wait!

19:29.880 --> 19:32.940
Being fully conscious in a 
stone body must have been agony.

19:33.540 --> 19:36.190
Y-You were conscious, Asahi?

19:36.460 --> 19:41.450
I-It's not my fault! It's not like 
I <i>tried</i> to see you naked, Maya-nee!

19:41.820 --> 19:43.410
What are you talking about?

19:43.410 --> 19:44.460
U-Uh, nothing.

19:44.460 --> 19:47.760
Excuse me! We've run out of towels!

19:47.760 --> 19:51.460
A-All right! I'll go get some. Just a moment!

19:52.080 --> 19:56.760
So, Asahi, do you have a reward for me?
 Money for alcohol, perhaps?

19:56.760 --> 19:58.920
Did you run up a tab again?

19:58.920 --> 20:01.040
Don't look so troubled!

20:01.040 --> 20:03.890
I could give you a little smooch if you like!

20:04.200 --> 20:06.850
You reek of booze! 
Don't put your face so close to mine!

20:18.700 --> 20:23.660
<i>She felt a sincere sense of embarrassment.
 It was an unexpectedly maidenly side of Maya.</i>

22:02.310 --> 22:04.960
Asahi-kun, your clan... It's kinda great!

22:06.410 --> 22:07.630
You think so?

22:06.900 --> 22:09.120
Our base will 
be my mansion!

22:07.170 --> 22:10.720
Amazing, Exalted Hero! 
Your harem has already taken shape!

22:07.630 --> 22:11.370
Yeah! It's like a new star 
that will carry the next age!

22:11.370 --> 22:13.560
Here. This is the application form.

22:13.560 --> 22:14.720
Thanks.

22:14.960 --> 22:18.100
So what did you decide to do
 about your clan name?

22:18.100 --> 22:20.230
Oh, about that...

22:20.230 --> 22:24.550
Glorious Five Stars! Five stars that 
will shine with honor and distinction.

22:24.550 --> 22:28.710
The Hero Alliance is better. 
I've been saying that since yesterday.

22:28.710 --> 22:30.860
Hawk of Gloomy Twilight.

22:30.860 --> 22:33.390
Guys, cut it out...

22:33.390 --> 22:37.000
This is where, as the lead character here, 
the Exalted Hero makes the decision!

22:37.000 --> 22:38.110
What a brilliant idea!

22:38.110 --> 22:39.150
I agree.

22:39.150 --> 22:40.250
Huh? Me?

22:40.250 --> 22:41.750
Come on, 
Exalted Hero!

22:40.250 --> 22:41.750
Asahi!

22:40.250 --> 22:41.750
Mister Asahi.

22:42.180 --> 22:44.000
Oh, um, well...

22:44.000 --> 22:47.760
<i>When they get this close, 
memories from last night start to...</i>

22:51.550 --> 22:53.180
Exalted Hero?!

22:51.550 --> 22:53.180
Asahi!

22:51.550 --> 22:53.180
Mister Asahi.

22:52.220 --> 22:53.710
The name is...

22:53.710 --> 22:54.630
We'll go with this.

22:55.020 --> 22:56.470
R-Right.

22:56.470 --> 22:57.520
Everyone!

22:58.110 --> 22:59.980
The name doesn't really matter, does it?

23:00.490 --> 23:03.230
What's important is our bond as allies.

23:03.230 --> 23:04.230
Right?

23:04.230 --> 23:06.770
Th-That's right! It's just as you say!

23:06.770 --> 23:10.470
That's Asahi's big sister for you!
 You make me want to call you Oneesan!

23:10.470 --> 23:13.060
Your true desire is spilling 
out everywhere, mistress.

23:13.750 --> 23:16.990
<i>Uh, but Maya-nee's taste in names is...</i>

23:16.990 --> 23:21.500
<b>Super Asahi Legion</b>

23:16.990 --> 23:21.500
<b>Ikusaba Asahi</b>

23:16.990 --> 23:21.500
<b>Ikusaba Maya</b>

23:16.990 --> 23:21.500
<b>Sophie Peaceful</b>

23:16.990 --> 23:21.500
<b>Gloria</b>

23:16.990 --> 23:21.500
<b>Kuon</b>

23:17.380 --> 23:19.800
Then, it's decided.

23:19.800 --> 23:21.500
The Super Asahi Legion!

23:23.500 --> 23:26.440
<i>That's so utterly uncool!</i>

23:26.440 --> 23:31.370
<i>And so, the Super Asahi Legion was formed.</i>

23:35.350 --> 23:36.400
<b>Next Time</b>

23:35.960 --> 23:38.180
Next time: "Shark from Another World."

23:36.440 --> 23:36.610
<b>Episode 11</b>

23:36.730 --> 23:41.060
<b>Episode 11</b>

23:37.060 --> 23:41.060
<b>Shark From Another World</b>
